 and evaluate a contemporary international issue from a particular theoretical perspective and level of analysis. The final paper will be due on November 10 via Canvas."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Grading:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":192.33333333333337,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":70.0,"r":117.66666666666667,"t":209.33333333333337},"charspan":[0,8],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/22","text":"Grading:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"This is a letter-graded course: A, B, C, Ds or F. The standard scale will apply: 90%-100% = A; 80%-89% = B; 70%-79% = C; 60%-69% = D; below 60% = F. grade","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":163.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":71.0,"r":517.6666666666666,"t":188.33333333333337},"charspan":[0,154],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/23","text":"This is a letter-graded course: A, B, C, Ds or F. The standard scale will apply: 90%-100% = A; 80%-89% = B; 70%-79% = C; 60%-69% = D; below 60% = F. grade"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Notice: Failure to meet assignment due dates could result in a of I (Incomplete) and may adversely impact Tuition Assistance and/or Financial Aid. grade","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":41.33333333333337,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":70.0,"r":536.6666666666666,"t":68.33333333333337},"charspan":[0,152],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/24","text":"Notice: Failure to meet assignment due dates could result in a of I (Incomplete) and may adversely impact Tuition Assistance and/or Financial Aid. grade"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_footer","orig":"3","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":23.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.6666666666667,"r":309.0,"t":31.66666666666663},"charspan":[0,1],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/25","text":"3"}],"version":"1.10.0"}